{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03546","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭同用华字 · 王勔","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭同用华字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上序披林馆，中京视物华。\n竹窗低露叶，梅迳起风花。\n景落春台雾，池侵旧渚沙。\n绮筵歌吹晚，暮雨泛香车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}